OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by
OL,4,Aambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being struck by an
OL,7,Fambulance transporting a patient near
OL,8,FSunderland, Northumbria Police said.
OL,10,FThe force said it happened on the A19
OL,11,Fshortly after 02:00 GMT.
OL,13,FThe ambulance was travelling on the
OL,14,Fnorthbound carriageway and did not have
OL,15,Fits blue lights on when it hit the man,
OL,16,Fwho was in his 30s and died at the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,19,FNo-one in the ambulance was injured and
OL,20,Fthe driver, a man in his 40s, remained
OL,21,Fat the scene to assist police with
OL,22,Ftheir inquiries, the force said.
